      <activity id="fd1d90db-0de2-5a88-8889-41150a342ff4" activityNameId="ab314834-9833-5aea-aca7-f542f78d6f3b" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, regional train</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, regional train
The data is based on the bulk material composition of the Kolibri, the most important Swiss train composition in regional traffic.  The life span of the lis assumed to be 40 years resulting in a life time performance of 6 Mio. vkm ;
UUID: 16aa36bb-6c31-48a8-9522-4ee6bf5e6696
The inventory includes waste treatment processes for non metal components of a Kolibri train composition. For the transport of disposed materials standard distances have been applied.
Location: Data represents Swiss disposal conditions
Technology: no technologies are specified
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data based on the material composition of an IC 2000. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_16aa36bb-6c31-48a8-9522-4ee6bf5e6696.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
